SCOPE
=====

This LICENSE file applies ONLY to the software components of this repository.

In scope (MIT License, below):
- Stylesheets (css/style.css)
- JavaScript code (js/main.js)
- HTML structural scaffolding: the semantic markup, <head> configuration,
  Schema.org JSON-LD structural setup (@context, @graph, @type declarations),
  and any generic template structure in index.html and privacy.html
- Build / tooling configuration files (.gitignore, sitemap.xml, robots.txt)

Out of scope (all rights reserved — see NOTICE.md):
- All written content and prose authored within index.html and privacy.html
  (including bio, About section, experience descriptions, achievements text,
  taglines, page copy, alt text, meta descriptions)
- The textual VALUES inside Schema.org JSON-LD (e.g., description, jobTitle,
  knowsAbout entries, alumniOf details, affiliation text) — the structure is
  MIT, the content authored within it is not
- The name "Luigi A. Moretti" used as a personal identifier on this site
- All images, graphics, illustrations, and photographs under public/ and
  images/ (including hero images, gallery photos, conference photos,
  achievement images, favicons, and open-graph images)
- Third-party logos under images/logos/ (used by permission or under
  fair-dealing exceptions; remain the property of their respective owners)
- MEMoPAD-related imagery appearing on this site, which is additionally
  subject to the rights statement in the MEMoPAD repository
  (https://github.com/LuigiAM/PhD_project_website) and pending UK registered
  design protection — see NOTICE.md §2.5

For permissions on out-of-scope materials, contact:
hello@luigimoretti.com

See NOTICE.md for the complete scope breakdown.

